{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_weedy_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_weedy_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"同舟","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_weedy_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e8e433386492cc5ef52f12364a880385f0e1ac21fd4262b1ecc084e93483bbd7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島 生物工程研究室\n10:00 A.M. 天氣/晴朗"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉抱歉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂，我已經用門口的噴淋裝置消過一遍毒了......來之前也沒做實驗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我進來嘍，可別再說一股機油味了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的合約快到期了，按照程式，續約前得有一次談話，我把續約的合約草稿帶來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實也沒什麼太大的變動，主要是人事部催我啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，怎麼一個人都沒有？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！我怎麼給忘了，十點，是溫蒂和煌的體能訓練時間，她應該在訓練場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露莉，這邊這邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思來遲了。我剛剛差點沒認出來你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有嗎？反倒是露莉，現在看起來完全就是個哥倫比亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟在特里蒙待了那麼久嘛。我們離開伊比利亞後，就沒有再見過面了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前“特里蒙生物工程前沿研討會”，你代表萊茵生命做學術彙報的時候，我就在台下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來想會議結束後和你打招呼，但臨時收到了醫療部的通訊，所以中途離場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你就是那位“因故棄權”的羅德島代表啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時醫療部臨時收治了一批危重病人，需要技術支援......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道研討會的發言名額有限，多少大學和科技公司擠破頭都爭取不到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"先急劇提升溫度，將敵人逼入特定的區域，再以鏈鋸橫劈，完成收尾的一擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呵！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌！停一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是可露希爾。我這一招怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很棒。怎麼只有你一個人在這兒轟轟轟，溫蒂呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的體能訓練取消了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我一開始以為是昨天的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天什麼事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"小心了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的高溫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要放水，我需要測試蓄水炮改裝後的極限功率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"關鍵是你吃得消蓄水炮的後坐力嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該沒問題。也正好檢驗下體能訓練的成果嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小葉，我們準備！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你把，溫蒂，擊飛了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"和這個沒有關係！溫蒂取消今天的體能訓練，是離艦去見一個同鄉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同鄉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說是萊茵生命的員工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前從沒聽溫蒂提起過......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊茵生命？！你就沒覺得哪裡不太對勁嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂是最早一批加入羅德島的，現在合約快到期了，我這幾天找了她好幾次，都沒見到人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她在此時去見一位就職於萊茵生命的同鄉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最關鍵的是，在前一天，她還在訓練中被某位精英幹員擊傷了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有受傷沒有受傷！我當時也嚇壞了，還特意拉溫蒂去醫療部做了全面檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"種種跡象表明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"應該不會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望不會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是體能訓練而已，為什麼要動真格的嘛。煌，你是什麼體格自己不清楚嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂當時也把我擊退了啊......她的體能和戰鬥技巧都提升了不少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個，這位小姐，不好意思打擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以把您的......這門炮，稍微挪一下嗎？擋住走道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，非常抱歉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂，這是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蓄水炮。只要儲備足量的水，就可以發射不同功率的強壓水流，或者將水流轉化為高溫蒸汽束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把它理解為一個可移動的能量源，羅德島本艦自動化工程的改造和升級，經常需要進行局域試驗，蓄水炮應用起來很方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，它就是一門炮。不管是強壓水流還是高溫蒸汽束，怎麼聽都更適合用來打擊敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"設計的時候，應用場景確實也考慮到了戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"研究者也需要武器嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島生物工程研究室的負責人，除了主持實驗，還需要參加戰鬥嗎？羅德島竟然沒有配備保護研究者的安保力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實造蓄水炮的想法，我還在伊比利亞的時候就有了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有時候想，要是那時有這樣的武器，我就可以把審判庭的人從爺爺的實驗室轟出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水炮可對付不了審判庭的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，挺幼稚的想法，所以現在它主要還是應用在工程建設上面嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，差點忘了正事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐，您找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們負責人還沒回來吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有。溫蒂小姐今天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經知道了。我去了你們的研究室，都沒看見她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"生物工程研究室暫停使用了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"您上次沒有消毒就衝進來，導致細菌監測系統報警，您忘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是馬上進行了清潔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"對，您用操作台的水龍頭洗了手，然後整個無菌用水系統也癱瘓了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是溫蒂自己調高了系統的智慧判定標準！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"所以溫蒂小姐決定對生物工程研究室進行全面的消殺，以及靜置循環一周，再投入使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有必要重新討論一下溫蒂的潔癖與研究室使用規範之間的必然聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，暫停了研究室的使用，不會影響你們新研究計畫的推進嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂不是上周才剛向我提交了好幾份新的項目報告和經費申請......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！我好像、忘了審批......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"訓練場武器系統升級......後勤部的採購清單......艦橋立面報修申請......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得明明放在這了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，好像把溫蒂送過來的申請材料弄丟了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"研究室暫停使用，新項目沒有批准，溫蒂一定很難過......你知道她這段時間在做什麼事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂小姐之前收到了一個包裹，好像是一些研究資料，是她的同鄉寄來的，她最近都在宿舍處理那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同鄉？是她今天去見的在萊茵生命工作的同鄉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，溫蒂已經開始參與其他公司的項目了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來她已經做好了決定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚，要怎麼向凱爾希和阿米婭交代......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，羅德島半數的自動化工程，都是溫蒂在入職後幫忙研發並配套的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是最早一批來羅德島的，得到的關心卻最少，想要離開也很好理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟她當初答應來羅德島，也僅僅是因為羅德島的offer發得比較快而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼看起來，無論是作為她的上司，還是同伴，我都太失職了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾小姐，您在嘀咕什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂和她同鄉見面的地點，你知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"助理幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是一個酒吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，差點忘了正事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你寄過來的資料，我已經整理好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涉及到以阿戈爾技術為支援的沿海工程部分，我專門校對了幾遍，有些模型和理論推演確實在爺爺的書稿裡出現過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太感謝了，溫蒂。我想著這一塊也只有你能幫到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊茵生命不缺專家，但對海洋和阿戈爾有所涉獵的，還真挑不出幾個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣，舉手之勞而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，畢竟離開伊比利亞太久了，現在那些模型和理論推演可能有新的變數需要納入，還是很難保證百分百無誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個沒關係，到時候我會再去實地考察。我只是想在回到伊比利亞之前，盡可能地整合已有的資源，對研究現狀有基礎的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"返回伊比利亞？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼這麼突然？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上個月，審判庭的信使找到了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們帶來了一份有關海洋工程的研究計畫，一封審判官的手寫信，以及審判庭開具的伊比利亞入境批文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這段時間幫我整理的，就是那份研究計畫會涉及的一部分歷史資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭居然會主動對外開放有關海洋的研究項目......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，如今的伊比利亞，在尋求改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經決定了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你在萊茵生命打拼了那麼久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我馬上就要從萊茵生命辭職了。當然離職手續很麻煩，項目移交、競業協議啊之類的，大公司就是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，誰讓我是個伊比利亞人。即使離得再遠，也還是能聞到空氣中濕潤的鹹味，然後循著味道返回伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這次來這，一是為了交接之前負責的萊茵生命外派項目的事宜，二是為了找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我和你一同返回伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露莉，我可能沒法答應你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為羅德島的關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂，恕我直言，羅德島並非一個理想的工作地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一家更偏重臨床應用的製藥公司，還時常糾纏在泰拉各地的危機事務間，能為你提供的科研條件是相當有限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你好不容易獲得在特里蒙生物工程前沿研討會的發言資格，卻不得不臨時退出，甚至有時候還需要充當武裝人員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這個我是不是解釋過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且據我所知，你和羅德島的合約快要到期了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，露莉，羅德島其實真不是你想像的那樣啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你爺爺當年的事情，溫蒂還是對伊比利亞無法釋懷吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得那時你常說一句話：“對科學設限的，從來都是人。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那句話是爺爺說的。說起來我當時勸了很久，想帶他一起離開伊比利亞，但沒有成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科學是向未知處的探索。可懷著熱忱投身其中的人們會發現他們面前有許多上鎖的抽屜。海洋、阿戈爾、大靜謐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有研究者會喜歡那樣的伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂，潮水已經湧上陸地，打濕了伊比利亞的腳踝，甚至有可能將它整個淹沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近羅德島新加入了幾位來自伊比利亞的幹員，你說的我也有所耳聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次回伊比利亞，我們可以要求審判庭解禁你爺爺當年的研究，它本來也和審判庭寄來的海洋工程計畫密切相關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的伊比利亞需要尋求改變。抽屜上的鎖正在慢慢鬆開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是露莉，我現在沒辦法跟你回伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個剛剛被你提起但又忽略的答案：我需要留在羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺很討厭伊比利亞，也很討厭審判庭，畢竟幾十年的心血就那麼付之一炬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但儘管研究所的資質都被取消了，他還是不願意離開伊比利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前以為他大概是年紀太大了，不願意再折騰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且哪裡又有不存在限制的科學自由之鄉呢？那類流亡然後客死他鄉的科學家故事太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我後來才慢慢想明白，他只是想要繼續守著熱愛的事業而已。他在等著抽屜的鎖鬆開，這樣就能第一時間重拾他的研究。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂小姐，恭喜你通過了全部考核，成為我們的一員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全部考核......也就這麼一次面試吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，畢竟羅德島剛剛成立，很缺人嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成立生物工程研究室，是我好不容易才說服阿米婭的。但是目前就只有你一個成員，所以它的發展壯大就靠你了，嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，經費、設備、前沿實驗......儘管開口，作為工程部的負責人，我會盡可能支持你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是“在研究室三小時以上，洗手消毒次數不得少於十次”的要求是不是可以再商量商量......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這是什麼表情？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"手術成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"幸虧溫蒂小姐連夜幫我們修復了醫療室的半自動設備，不然手術根本沒法安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那場研討會很重要吧，畢竟您之前寫了那麼久的論文。突然把您叫回來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。新收治的五位感染者已經全部脫離危險了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，有個孩子說想和您的仿生海龍聊聊天，她說是您在手術前答應了的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。那我現在進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您已經很累了吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思我應該控制下力量的。有沒有哪裡受傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂，其實你安心做實驗就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你說我體質太虛弱了，要進行單獨體能訓練的嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是你不用參加戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於礦石病來說，透過手術和實驗能解決的，只是很小的一部分問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"好了不要講課了，反正記得站在我身後，雖然在戰場上可能顧不上，但是把敵人都解決掉的話，溫蒂也就沒有危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小瞧工程蓄水炮的威力啊，你剛剛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我選擇留在羅德島，和爺爺不願意離開他的研究所，和你現在選擇回到伊比利亞的原因，是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是因為害怕遠方存在的限制，僅僅是因為，這裡有我熱愛，而且必須要堅持的事業而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"服務生","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，這位客人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂溫蒂，你真的不再考慮一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道煌那個人就那樣，一戰鬥就容易亢奮，她真的不是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也知道我這個人就這樣，事情太多了就容易顧不過來，嗚嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你上周提交的項目報告和經費申請，沒有收到回覆，不是不給批，只是因為我不小心把文件弄丟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"名稱我都還記得呢，“異質施術單元的聯控嘗試”“以燈塔元件反溯阿戈爾的海洋技術”......很有價值的研究方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（海洋技術......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弄丟了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當時現場就簽字讓我帶回了啊，你忘啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......總之，我希望你能慎重考慮，繼續留在羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你為什麼覺得我會離開羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天人事部催我找你談續約的事，一直沒找到你人，我剛剛去了研究室，你也不在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"露莉要回伊比利亞了，我來送送她。哦介紹一下，這是露莉，萊茵生命的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我馬上就從萊茵生命離職了。我叫露莉，溫蒂的同鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離職？所以你們今天不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我叫可露希爾，羅德島工程部負責人，溫蒂的上司和朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_007_closre_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有打擾到你們吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。也聊得差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溫蒂，我大概明白你的選擇了。我尊重你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且原來你是有打算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是現在......總之謝謝你來看我。一路順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"露莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avg_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你剛剛說，你今天進了生物工程研究室？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道研究室剛剛全面消殺需要靜置循環一周嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]}]}
